cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the paper below."
title: "love-lies: content-filter evaluation artifact"
abstract: >-
  Evaluation artifact measuring whether commercial content moderation systems
  (OpenAI Moderation API, Google Perspective API, Meta LLaMA Guard 3) detect
  romance-baiting scam conversations, compared against e-commerce fraud, tax
  scams and benign controls.
